"Learn More" = "瞭解更多";
"Tip title" = "提示標題";
"Tip content" = "提示內容";
"iTerm2 tip of the day" = "iTerm2 每日提示";
"See Tips of the Day?" = "查看每日提示？";
"iTerm2 can show you a Tip of the Day message to help you learn about its many features. Are you interested?" = "iTerm2 可向您顯示每日提示訊息，協助您瞭解其眾多功能。您感興趣嗎？";
"Yes" = "是";
"No" = "否";
"Dismiss Tip" = "關閉提示";
"Fewer Options" = "更少選項";
"More Options" = "更多選項";
"Show This Later" = "稍後顯示";
"Disable Tips" = "停用提示";
"Enable Tips" = "啟用提示";
"Show Next Tip" = "顯示下一條提示";
"Show Previous Tip" = "顯示上一條提示";
"Show Tips Weekly" = "每週顯示提示";
"Show Tips Daily" = "每天顯示提示";
"Share" = "分享";
"iTerm2 Tip of the Day" = "iTerm2 每日提示";
"Tip of the Day" = "每日提示";
"This window shows the iTerm2 tip of the day. It’ll appear every 24 hours to let you know about new features and hidden secrets. Hit “More Options” to view more tips or to stop getting them altogether." = "此視窗顯示 iTerm2 每日提示。它每 24 小時出現一次，讓您瞭解新功能和隱藏技巧。點擊「更多選項」可查看更多提示或完全停止接收。";
"Shell Integration" = "Shell 整合";
"The big new feature of iTerm2 version 3 is Shell Integration. Click “Learn More” for all the details." = "iTerm2 版本 3 的重大新功能是 Shell 整合。點擊「瞭解更多」取得所有詳情。";
"Timestamps" = "時間戳";
"“View > Show Timestamps” shows the time (and date, if appropriate) when each line was last modified." = "「檢視 > 顯示時間戳」會顯示每行最後修改的時間（及日期，如適用）。";
"Password Manager" = "密碼管理器";
"Did you know iTerm2 has a password manager? Open it with “Window > Password Manager.” You can define a Trigger to open it for you at a password prompt in “Settings > Profiles > Advanced > Triggers.”" = "您知道 iTerm2 有密碼管理器嗎？用「視窗 > 密碼管理器」開啟它。您可以在「設定 > 設定檔 > 進階 > 觸發器」中定義一個觸發器，在密碼提示處自動開啟它。";
"Open Quickly" = "快速開啟";
"You can quickly search through your sessions with “View > Open Quickly” (⇧⌘O). You can type a query and sessions whose name, badge, current hostname, current user name, recent commands, and recent working directories match will be surfaced. It works best with Shell Integration so the user name, hostname, command, and directories can be known even while sshed." = "您可以用「檢視 > 快速開啟」（⇧⌘O）快速搜尋工作階段。輸入查詢後，名稱、徽章、目前主機名稱、目前使用者名稱、最近指令和最近工作目錄相符的工作階段將會顯示。配合 Shell 整合效果最佳，這樣即使在 ssh 連線中也能知道使用者名稱、主機名稱、指令和目錄。";
"Undo Close" = "還原關閉";
"If you close a session, tab, or window by accident you can undo it with “Edit > Undo” (⌘Z). By default you have five seconds to undo, but you can adjust that timeout in “Settings > Profiles > Session.”" = "如果您不小心關閉了工作階段、分頁或視窗，可以用「編輯 > 還原」（⌘Z）還原。預設有五秒鐘可以還原，但您可以在「設定 > 設定檔 > 工作階段」中調整該逾時時間。";
"Annotations" = "註解";
"Want to mark up your scrollback history? Right click on a selection and choose “Annotate Selection” to add a personal note to it. Use “View > Show Annotations” to show or hide them, and look in “Edit > Marks and Annotations” for more things you can do." = "想在回捲歷史中做標記嗎？右鍵點擊選取範圍並選擇「為選取範圍新增註解」即可為其新增個人備註。用「檢視 > 顯示註解」來顯示或隱藏它們，並在「編輯 > 標記和註解」中查看更多可用操作。";
"Copy with Styles" = "帶樣式複製";
"Copy a selection with ⌥⌘C to include styles such as colors and fonts. You can make this the default action for Copy in “Settings > Advanced.”" = "用 ⌥⌘C 複製選取範圍可包含顏色和字型等樣式。您可以在「設定 > 進階」中將此設為複製的預設行為。";
"Inline Images" = "內嵌圖片";
"iTerm2 can display images (even animated GIFs) inline." = "iTerm2 可以內嵌顯示圖片（甚至是動態 GIF）。";
"Automatic Profile Switching" = "自動切換設定檔";
"Automatic Profile Switching changes the current profile when the username, hostname, or directory changes. Set it up in “Settings > Profiles > Advanced.” It requires Shell Integration to be installed." = "自動切換設定檔會在使用者名稱、主機名稱或目錄變化時切換目前設定檔。在「設定 > 設定檔 > 進階」中設定。它需要安裝 Shell 整合。";
"Captured Output" = "擷取的輸出";
"iTerm2 can act like an IDE using the Captured Output feature. When it sees text matching a regular expression you define, like compiler errors, it shows the matching lines in the Toolbelt. You can click to jump to the line in your terminal and double-click to perform an action like opening an editor to the line with the error." = "iTerm2 可透過擷取的輸出功能像 IDE 一樣運作。當它看到與您定義的正規表示式匹配的文字（如編譯器錯誤）時，會在工具列中顯示匹配行。您可以點擊跳轉到終端機中的該行，雙擊可執行動作（如在編輯器中開啟出錯行）。";
"Badges" = "徽章";
"You can display a status message in the top right of your session in the background. It’s called a “Badge.” If you install Shell Integration you can include info like user name, hostname, current directory, and more." = "您可以在工作階段右上角背景顯示一條狀態訊息。它叫做「徽章」。如果安裝了 Shell 整合，您可以包含使用者名稱、主機名稱、目前目錄等資訊。";
"Dynamic Profiles" = "動態設定檔";
"Dynamic Profiles let you store your profiles as one or more JSON files. It’s great for batch creating and editing profiles." = "動態設定檔讓您將設定檔儲存為一個或多個 JSON 檔案。它非常適合批量建立和編輯設定檔。";
"Advanced Paste" = "進階貼上";
"“Edit > Paste Special > Advanced Paste” lets you preview and edit text before you paste. You get to tweak options, like how to handle control codes, or even to base-64 encode before pasting." = "「編輯 > 特殊貼上 > 進階貼上」讓您在貼上前預覽和編輯文字。您可以調整選項，比如如何處理控制字元，甚至在貼上前進行 base-64 編碼。";
"Zoom" = "縮放";
"Ever wanted to focus on a block of lines without distraction, or limit Find to a single command’s output? Select the lines and choose “View > Zoom In on Selection.” The session’s contents will be temporarily replaced with the selection. Press “esc” to unzoom." = "是否想專注於一組行而不受干擾，或將尋找限制在單一指令的輸出中？選取這些行並選擇「檢視 > 放大選取範圍」。工作階段內容將被臨時替換為選取範圍。按「esc」退出縮放。";
"Semantic History" = "語意歷史";
"The “Semantic History” feature allows you to ⌘-click on a file or URL to open it." = "「語意歷史」功能允許您按住 ⌘ 點擊檔案或 URL 來開啟它。";
"Tmux Integration" = "Tmux 整合";
"If you use tmux, try running “tmux -CC” to get iTerm2’s tmux integration mode. The tmux windows show up as native iTerm2 windows, and you can use iTerm2’s keyboard shortcuts. It even works over ssh!" = "如果您使用 tmux，試試執行「tmux -CC」來取得 iTerm2 的 tmux 整合模式。tmux 視窗會顯示為原生 iTerm2 視窗，您可以使用 iTerm2 的鍵盤快速鍵。它甚至可以透過 ssh 使用！";
"Triggers" = "觸發器";
"iTerm2 can automatically perform actions you define when text matching a regular expression is received. For example, you can highlight text or show an alert box. Set it up in “Settings > Profiles > Advanced > Triggers.”" = "iTerm2 可在收到與您定義的正規表示式匹配的文字時自動執行動作。例如，您可以高亮文字或顯示警告框。在「設定 > 設定檔 > 進階 > 觸發器」中設定。";
"Smart Selection" = "智慧選取";
"Quadruple click to perform Smart Selection. It figures out if you’re selecting a URL, filename, email address, etc. based on prioritized regular expressions." = "四連擊可執行智慧選取。它會根據優先順序正規表示式判斷您選取的是 URL、檔名、電子郵件地址等。";
"Instant Replay" = "即時回放";
"Press ⌥⌘B to step back in time in a terminal window. Use arrow keys to go frame by frame. Hold ⇧ and press arrow keys to go faster." = "按 ⌥⌘B 可在終端機視窗中回溯時間。用方向鍵逐幀前進。按住 ⇧ 再按方向鍵可加快速度。";
"Hotkey Window" = "熱鍵視窗";
"You can have a terminal window open with a keystroke, even while in other apps. Click “Create a Dedicated Hotkey Window” in “Settings > Keys.”" = "您可以用快速鍵開啟終端機視窗，即使在其他應用程式中也可以。在「設定 > 鍵」中點擊「建立專屬熱鍵視窗」。";
"Hotkey windows can stay open after losing focus. Turn it on in “Window > Pin Hotkey Window.”" = "熱鍵視窗在失去焦點後可以保持開啟。在「視窗 > 固定熱鍵視窗」中開啟。";
"Cursor Guide" = "游標引導線";
"The cursor guide is a horizontal line that follows your cursor. You can turn it on in “Settings > Profiles > Colors” or toggle it with the ⌥⌘; shortcut." = "游標引導線是跟隨游標的水平線。您可以在「設定 > 設定檔 > 顏色」中開啟，或用 ⌥⌘; 快速鍵切換。";
"Shell Integration: Alerts" = "Shell 整合：提醒";
"The Shell Integration feature lets you ask to be alerted (⌥⌘A) when a long-running command completes." = "Shell 整合功能可讓您在長時間執行的指令完成時收到提醒（⌥⌘A）。";
"Cursor Blink Rate" = "游標閃爍頻率";
"You can configure how quickly the cursor blinks in “Settings > Advanced.”" = "您可以在「設定 > 進階」中設定游標閃爍的速度。";
"Shell Integration: Navigation" = "Shell 整合：導覽";
"The Shell Integration feature lets you navigate among shell prompts with ⇧⌘↑ and ⇧⌘↓." = "Shell 整合功能可讓您用 ⇧⌘↑ 和 ⇧⌘↓ 在 shell 提示符之間導覽。";
"Shell Integration: Status" = "Shell 整合：狀態";
"The Shell Integration feature puts a blue arrow next to your shell prompt. If you run a command that fails, it turns red. Right click on it to get the running time and status." = "Shell 整合功能會在 shell 提示符旁放一個藍色箭頭。如果您執行的指令失敗，它會變紅。右鍵點擊它可查看執行時間和狀態。";
"Shell Integration: Selection" = "Shell 整合：選取";
"With Shell Integration installed, you can select the output of the last command with ⇧⌘A." = "安裝 Shell 整合後，您可以用 ⇧⌘A 選取上一條指令的輸出。";
"Bells" = "響鈴";
"The dock icon shows a count of the number of bells rung and notifications posted since the app was last active." = "Dock 圖示會顯示自應用程式上次活動以來響鈴和發布通知的次數。";
"Shell Integration: Downloads" = "Shell 整合：下載";
"If you install Shell Integration on a machine you ssh to, you can right click on a filename (for example, in the output of “ls”) and choose “Download with scp” to download the file." = "如果您在 ssh 連線的機器上安裝了 Shell 整合，可以右鍵點擊檔名（例如在「ls」的輸出中）並選擇「用 scp 下載」來下載檔案。";
"Find Your Cursor" = "找到您的游標";
"Press ⌘/ to locate your cursor. It’s fun!" = "按 ⌘/ 定位您的游標。很有趣！";
"Customize Smart Selection" = "自訂智慧選取";
"You can edit Smart Selection regular expressions in “Settings > Profiles > Advanced > Smart Selection.”" = "您可以在「設定 > 設定檔 > 進階 > 智慧選取」中編輯智慧選取正規表示式。";
"Smart Selection Actions" = "智慧選取動作";
"Assign an action to a Smart Selection rule in “Settings > Profiles > Advanced > Smart Selection > Edit Actions.” They go in the context menu and override semantic history on ⌘-click." = "在「設定 > 設定檔 > 進階 > 智慧選取 > 編輯動作」中為智慧選取規則分配動作。它們會出現在快顯功能表中，並在 ⌘ 點擊時覆蓋語意歷史。";
"Visual Bell" = "視覺響鈴";
"If you want the visual bell to flash the whole screen instead of show a bell icon, you can turn that on in “Settings > Advanced.”" = "如果您想讓視覺響鈴閃爍整個螢幕而不是顯示鈴鐺圖示，可以在「設定 > 進階」中開啟。";
"Tab Menu" = "分頁選單";
"Right click on a tab to change its color, close tabs after it, or to close all other tabs." = "右鍵點擊分頁可更改其顏色、關閉其後的分頁或關閉所有其他分頁。";
"Tags" = "標籤";
"You can assign tags to your profiles, and by clicking “Tags>” anywhere you see a list of profiles you can browse those tags." = "您可以為設定檔分配標籤，在任何設定檔列表中點擊「標籤>」即可瀏覽這些標籤。";
"Tag Hierarchy" = "標籤階層";
"If you put a slash in a profile’s tag, that implicitly defines a hierarchy. You can see it in the Profiles menu as nested submenus." = "如果在設定檔的標籤中加斜線，會隱式定義一個階層。您可以在「設定檔」選單中看到它作為巢狀子選單。";
"Downloads" = "下載";
"iTerm2 can download files by base-64 encoding them. Click “Learn More” to download a shell script that makes it easy." = "iTerm2 可透過 base-64 編碼下載檔案。點擊「瞭解更多」下載一個簡化此操作的 shell 指令稿。";
"Command Completion" = "指令補全";
"If you install Shell Integration, ⇧⌘; helps you complete commands. It remembers the commands you’ve run on each host that has Shell Integration installed. It knows how often that command was run and how recently to help make the best suggestions." = "如果安裝了 Shell 整合，⇧⌘; 可幫您補全指令。它會記住您在每個安裝了 Shell 整合的主機上執行過的指令，並根據執行頻率和近期程度給出最佳建議。";
"Recent Directories" = "最近目錄";
"iTerm2 remembers which directories you use the most on each host that has Shell Integration installed. There’s a Toolbelt tool to browse them, and ⌥⌘/ gives you a popup sorted by frequency and recency of use." = "iTerm2 會記住您在每個安裝了 Shell 整合的主機上最常用的目錄。工具列中有一個工具可瀏覽它們，⌥⌘/ 會彈出一個按使用頻率和近期程度排序的列表。";
"Favorite Directories" = "收藏目錄";
"If you have Shell Integration installed, you can “star” a directory to keep it always at the bottom of the Recent Directories tool in the Toolbelt. Right click and choose “Toggle Star.”" = "如果安裝了 Shell 整合，您可以給目錄加「星標」，使其始終顯示在工具列的最近目錄工具底部。右鍵點擊並選擇「切換星標」。";
"Shell Integration History" = "Shell 整合歷史";
"Install Shell Integration and turn on “Settings > General > Save copy/paste and command history to disk” to remember command history per host across restarts of iTerm2." = "安裝 Shell 整合並開啟「設定 > 一般 > 將複製/貼上和指令歷史儲存到磁碟」，即可在 iTerm2 重啟後按主機記住指令歷史。";
"Paste File as Base64" = "將檔案貼上為 Base64";
"Copy a file to the pasteboard in Finder and then use “Edit > Paste Special > Paste File Base64-Encoded” for easy uploads of binary files. Use ”base64 -D” (or -d on Linux) on the remote host to decode it." = "在 Finder 中將檔案拷貝到剪貼簿，然後用「編輯 > 特殊貼上 > 貼上 Base64 編碼的檔案」即可輕鬆上傳二進位檔案。在遠端主機上用「base64 -D」（Linux 上用 -d）解碼。";
"Split Panes" = "分割窗格";
"You can split a tab into multiple panes with ⌘D and ⇧⌘D." = "您可以用 ⌘D 和 ⇧⌘D 將分頁拆分為多個分割窗格。";
"Adjust Split Panes" = "調整分割窗格";
"Resize split panes with the keyboard using ^⌘-Arrow Key." = "用鍵盤 ^⌘-方向鍵調整分割窗格大小。";
"Move Cursor" = "移動游標";
"Hold ⌥ and click to move your cursor. It works best with Shell Integration installed (to avoid sending up/down arrow keys to your shell)." = "按住 ⌥ 並點擊可移動游標。安裝 Shell 整合後效果最佳（可避免向 shell 發送上下方向鍵）。";
"Edge Windows" = "邊緣視窗";
"You can tell your profile to create windows that are attached to one edge of the screen in “Settings > Profiles > Window.” You can resize them by dragging the edges." = "您可以在「設定 > 設定檔 > 視窗」中讓設定檔建立附著在螢幕一側的視窗。您可以透過拖動邊緣調整大小。";
"Tab Color" = "分頁顏色";
"You can assign colors to tabs in “Settings > Profiles > Colors,” or in the View menu." = "您可以在「設定 > 設定檔 > 顏色」或檢視選單中為分頁分配顏色。";
"Rectangular Selection" = "矩形選取";
"Hold ⌥⌘ while dragging to make a rectangular selection." = "拖動時按住 ⌥⌘ 可進行矩形選取。";
"Multiple Selection" = "多重選取";
"Hold ⌘ while dragging to make multiple discontinuous selections." = "拖動時按住 ⌘ 可進行多個不連續的選取。";
"Dragging Panes" = "拖動分割窗格";
"Hold ⇧⌥⌘ and drag a session into another session to create or change split panes." = "按住 ⇧⌥⌘ 將一個工作階段拖入另一個工作階段可建立或更改分割窗格。";
"Cursor Boost" = "游標增強";
"Adjust Cursor Boost in “Settings > Profiles > Colors” to make all colors more muted, except the cursor. Use a bright white cursor and it pops!" = "在「設定 > 設定檔 > 顏色」中調整游標增強，可使除游標外的所有顏色更柔和。使用亮白色游標，它會非常醒目！";
"Minimum Contrast" = "最低對比度";
"Adjust “Minimum Contrast” in “Settings > Profiles > Colors” to ensure text is always legible regardless of text/background color combination." = "在「設定 > 設定檔 > 顏色」中調整「最低對比度」，可確保無論文字/背景顏色如何組合，文字始終清晰可讀。";
"Tabs" = "分頁";
"Normally, new tabs appear at the end of the tab bar. There’s a setting in “Settings > Advanced” to place them next to your current tab." = "通常新分頁出現在分頁列末尾。在「設定 > 進階」中有一項設定可將它們放在目前分頁旁邊。";
"Base Conversion" = "進位轉換";
"Right-click on a number and the context menu shows it converted to hex or decimal as appropriate." = "右鍵點擊數字，快顯功能表會顯示其轉換為十六進位或十進位的結果。";
"Saved Searches" = "儲存的搜尋";
"In “Settings > Keys” you can assign a keystroke to a search for a regular expression with the “Find Regular Expression…” action." = "在「設定 > 鍵」中，您可以用「尋找正規表示式…」動作將快速鍵分配給正規表示式搜尋。";
"Find URLs" = "尋找 URL";
"Search for URLs using “Edit > Find > Find URLs.” Navigate search results with ⌘G and ⇧⌘G. Open the current selection with ⌥⌘O." = "用「編輯 > 尋找 > 尋找 URL」搜尋 URL。用 ⌘G 和 ⇧⌘G 導覽搜尋結果。用 ⌥⌘O 開啟目前選取範圍。";
"The “instant” checkbox in a Trigger allows it to fire while the cursor is on the same line as the text that matches your regular expression." = "觸發器中的「即時」核取方塊允許它在游標與匹配正規表示式的文字位於同一行時觸發。";
"Soft Boundaries" = "軟邊界";
"Turn on “Edit > Selection Respects Soft Boundaries” to recognize split pane dividers in programs like vi, emacs, and tmux so you can select multiple lines of text." = "開啟「編輯 > 選取範圍遵守軟邊界」可識別 vi、emacs 和 tmux 等程式中的分割窗格分隔符，從而選取多行文字。";
"Select Without Dragging" = "無需拖動即可選取";
"Single click where you want to start a selection and ⇧-click where you want it to end to select text without dragging." = "在想要開始選取範圍的位置單擊，在想要結束的位置按住 ⇧ 點擊，即可無需拖動選取文字。";
"Smooth Window Resizing" = "平滑調整視窗大小";
"Hold ^ while resizing a window and it won’t snap to the character grid: you can make it any size you want." = "調整視窗大小時按住 ^，它不會對齊到字元格線：您可以調整為任意大小。";
"Pasting Tabs" = "貼上定位字元";
"If you paste text containing tabs, you’ll be asked if you want to convert them to spaces. It’s handy at the shell prompt to avoid triggering filename completion." = "如果您貼上包含定位字元的文字，系統會詢問您是否將它們轉換為空格。這在 shell 提示符處很方便，可避免觸發檔名補全。";
"Bell Silencing" = "響鈴靜音";
"Did you know? If the bell rings too often, you’ll be asked if you’d like to silence it temporarily. iTerm2 cares about your comfort." = "您知道嗎？如果響鈴過於頻繁，系統會詢問您是否暫時靜音。iTerm2 關心您的舒適體驗。";
"Profile Search" = "設定檔搜尋";
"Every list of profiles has a search field (e.g., in ”Settings > Profiles.”) You can use various operators to restrict your search query. Click “Learn More” for all the details." = "每個設定檔列表都有搜尋框（例如在「設定 > 設定檔」中）。您可以使用各種運算子來限制搜尋查詢。點擊「瞭解更多」取得所有詳情。";
"Color Schemes" = "配色方案";
"The online color gallery features over one hundred beautiful color schemes you can download." = "線上配色庫提供了一百多種可供下載的精美配色方案。";
"ASCII/Non-Ascii Fonts" = "ASCII/非 ASCII 字型";
"You can have a separate font for ASCII versus non-ASCII text. Enable it in “Settings > Profiles > Text.”" = "您可以為 ASCII 和非 ASCII 文字分別使用不同字型。在「設定 > 設定檔 > 文字」中啟用。";
"Coprocesses" = "協同處理";
"A coprocess is a job, such as a shell script, that has a special relationship with a particular iTerm2 session. All output in a terminal window (that is, what you see on the screen) is also input to the coprocess. All output from the coprocess acts like text that the user is typing at the keyboard." = "協同處理是一個任務（如 shell 指令稿），與特定 iTerm2 工作階段有特殊關係。終端機視窗中的所有輸出（即您在螢幕上看到的內容）也是協同處理的輸入。協同處理的所有輸出就像使用者在鍵盤上輸入的文字。";
"Touch Bar Customization" = "觸控列自訂";
"You can customize the touch bar by selecting “View > Customize Touch Bar.” You can add a tab bar for full-screen mode, a user-customizable status button, and you can even define your own touch bar buttons in Settings > Keys. There’s also a new shell integration tool to customize touch bar function key labels." = "您可以透過選擇「檢視 > 自訂觸控列」來自訂觸控列。您可以為全螢幕模式新增分頁列、使用者可自訂的狀態按鈕，甚至可以在「設定 > 鍵」中定義自己的觸控列按鈕。還有一個新的 Shell 整合工具可自訂觸控列功能鍵標籤。";
"Ligatures" = "連字";
"If you use a font that supports ligatures, you can enable ligature support in Settings > Profiles > Text." = "如果您使用支援連字的字型，可以在「設定 > 設定檔 > 文字」中啟用連字支援。";
"Floating Hotkey Window" = "浮動熱鍵視窗";
"New in 3.1: You can configure your hotkey window to appear over other apps’ full screen windows. Turn on “Floating Window” in “Settings > Profiles > Keys > Customize Hotkey Window.”" = "3.1 新功能：您可以將熱鍵視窗設定為顯示在其他應用程式的全螢幕視窗之上。在「設定 > 設定檔 > 鍵 > 自訂熱鍵視窗」中開啟「浮動視窗」。";
"Multiple Hotkey Windows" = "多個熱鍵視窗";
"New in 3.1: You can have multiple hotkey windows. Each profile can have one or more hotkeys." = "3.1 新功能：您可以擁有多個熱鍵視窗。每個設定檔可以有一個或多個熱鍵。";
"Double-Tap Hotkey" = "雙擊熱鍵";
"New in 3.1: You can configure a hotkey window to open on double-tap of a modifier in “Settings > Profiles > Keys > Customize Hotkey Window.”" = "3.1 新功能：您可以在「設定 > 設定檔 > 鍵 > 自訂熱鍵視窗」中設定熱鍵視窗在雙擊修飾鍵時開啟。";
"Buried Sessions" = "隱藏的工作階段";
"You can “bury” a session with “Session > Bury Session.” It remains hidden until you restore it by selecting it from “Session > Buried Sessions > Your session.”" = "您可以用「工作階段 > 隱藏工作階段」來「隱藏」一個工作階段。它會保持隱藏，直到您從「工作階段 > 已隱藏的工作階段 > 您的工作階段」中選擇還原。";
"Python API" = "Python API";
"You can add custom behavior to iTerm2 using the Python API." = "您可以使用 Python API 為 iTerm2 新增自訂行為。";
"Status Bar" = "狀態列";
"You can add a configurable status bar to your terminal windows." = "您可以為終端機視窗新增可設定的狀態列。";
"Minimal Theme" = "極簡主題";
"Try the “Minimal” and “Compact” themes to reduce visual clutter. You can set it in “Settings > Appearance > General.”" = "試試「極簡」和「緊湊」主題以減少視覺雜亂。您可以在「設定 > 外觀 > 一般」中設定。";
"Session Titles" = "工作階段標題";
"You can configure which elements are present in session titles in “Settings > Profiles > General > Title.”" = "您可以在「設定 > 設定檔 > 一般 > 標題」中設定工作階段標題中包含哪些元素。";
"Tab Icons" = "分頁圖示";
"Tabs can show an icon indicating the current application. Configure it in “Settings > Profiles > General > Icon.”" = "分頁可顯示指示目前應用程式的圖示。在「設定 > 設定檔 > 一般 > 圖示」中設定。";
"Drag Window by Tab" = "透過分頁拖動視窗";
"Hold ⌥ while dragging a tab to move the window. This is useful in the Compact and Minimal themes, which have a very small area for dragging the window." = "拖動分頁時按住 ⌥ 可移動視窗。這在緊湊和極簡主題中很有用，因為它們用於拖動視窗的區域很小。";
"Composer" = "編輯器";
"Press ⇧⌘. to open the Composer. It gives you a scratchpad to edit a command before sending it to the shell." = "按 ⇧⌘. 開啟編輯器。它提供一個臨時編輯區，讓您在將指令傳送到 shell 前先編輯。";
"Shell Integration: Uploads" = "Shell 整合：上傳";
"If you install Shell Integration on a machine you ssh to, you can drag-drop from Finder into the remote host by holding ⌥ while dragging. The destination directory is determined by where you drop the file in the terminal window: run cd foo, then drop the file below the cd command, and the file will go into the foo directory." = "如果您在 ssh 連線的機器上安裝了 Shell 整合，可以按住 ⌥ 從 Finder 拖放檔案到遠端主機。目標目錄由您在終端機視窗中放置檔案的位置決定：執行 cd foo，然後將檔案放在 cd 指令下方，檔案就會進入 foo 目錄。";
"Composer Power Features" = "編輯器進階功能";
"The composer supports multiple cursors. It also has the ability to send just one command out of a list, making it easy to walk through a list of commands one-by-one. Click the help button in the composer for details." = "編輯器支援多游標。它還能從列表中僅傳送一條指令，便於逐條執行指令列表。點擊編輯器中的說明按鈕瞭解詳情。";
"Render Selection" = "算繪選取範圍";
"Transform selected text into a prettified, syntax-highlighted view with the “Render Selection” command, ideal for JSON, Markdown, or source code. This feature includes horizontal scrolling for easy log navigation." = "用「算繪選取範圍」指令將選取文字轉換為美化、語法高亮的視圖，非常適合 JSON、Markdown 或原始碼。此功能包含水平捲動，便於日誌導覽。";
"SSH Integration" = "SSH 整合";
"Export environment variables and copy files to remote hosts seamlessly with SSH integration. Either configure a profile to use ssh or use it2ssh in place of ssh." = "透過 SSH 整合無縫匯出環境變數和拷貝檔案到遠端主機。可以設定設定檔使用 ssh，或用 it2ssh 代替 ssh。";
"Auto Composer" = "自動編輯器";
"Improve your command line with the “auto composer”, which replaces the command line with a native control for ease of use. Requires shell integration." = "用「自動編輯器」改進您的命令列，它用原生控制項替換命令列以方便使用。需要 Shell 整合。";
"AI Command Writing" = "AI 指令撰寫";
"Generate commands using AI by entering a prompt in the composer and selecting “Edit > Engage Artificial Intelligence”. An OpenAI API key is required for this functionality." = "在編輯器中輸入提示並選擇「編輯 > 啟用人工智慧」，即可用 AI 產生指令。此功能需要 OpenAI API 金鑰。";
"Codecierge Tool" = "Codecierge 工具";
"Set and achieve terminal goals with “Codecierge”, a Toolbelt feature that guides you step-by-step based on your terminal activity. An OpenAI API key is necessary for this feature." = "用「Codecierge」設定並實現終端目標，這是一個工具列功能，會根據您的終端活動逐步引導您。此功能需要 OpenAI API 金鑰。";
"Named Marks" = "具名標記";
"Navigate your command history effortlessly with “named marks” by assigning names to lines in the terminal." = "用「具名標記」為終端機中的行分配名稱，輕鬆導覽您的指令歷史。";
"Font Assignments" = "字型分配";
"You can assign specific fonts to Unicode ranges. Use 'Settings > Profiles > Text > Manage Special Exceptions' to manage it and to install a huge set of Powerline symbols." = "您可以為 Unicode 區段分配特定字型。用「設定 > 設定檔 > 文字 > 管理特殊例外」來管理，並安裝大量 Powerline 符號。";
"Disable Transparency" = "停用透明度";
"Maintain clarity in your active window while enjoying transparency in background windows by using 'View > Disable transparency in key window'." = "用「檢視 > 在關鍵視窗中停用透明度」，可在活動視窗中保持清晰，同時在背景視窗中享受透明效果。";
"Leader Shortcut" = "前導鍵快速鍵";
"Create two-keystroke shortcuts with a “leader”: a special keystroke that precedes a custom key binding." = "用「前導鍵」建立雙鍵快速鍵：一種在自訂按鍵綁定之前的特殊按鍵。";
"Sequence Binding" = "序列綁定";
"Execute a series of actions in order with a single shortcut using “sequence” key bindings." = "用「序列」按鍵綁定，透過單一快速鍵按順序執行一系列動作。";
"Export/Import Settings" = "匯出/匯入設定";
"Easily backup or transfer your iTerm2 settings using the Export/Import feature in “Settings > General > Settings”." = "用「設定 > 一般 > 設定」中的匯出/匯入功能，輕鬆備份或傳輸您的 iTerm2 設定。";
"Multi-Session Bindings" = "多工作階段綁定";
"Apply key bindings uniformly across multiple sessions for consistent control in different tabs or windows." = "在多個工作階段中統一套用按鍵綁定，以便在不同分頁或視窗中保持一致的控制。";
"Inject Trigger" = "注入觸發器";
"Simulate terminal input as if it were output from a running app with the “Inject” trigger." = "用「注入」觸發器模擬終端機輸入，就像來自執行中應用程式的輸出一樣。";
"Trigger Status Bar" = "觸發器狀態列";
"Easily manage your triggers using the new Triggers status bar component." = "使用新的觸發器狀態列元件輕鬆管理您的觸發器。";
"Session Size in Tab" = "分頁中顯示工作階段大小";
"Display session size directly in tab titles for convenient at-a-glance information." = "在分頁標題中直接顯示工作階段大小，方便一目了然。";
"Advanced Snippet Editing" = "進階程式碼片段編輯";
"Edit snippets in Advanced Paste by holding the ⌥ key, or open them in the composer with ⇧." = "在進階貼上中按住 ⌥ 鍵編輯程式碼片段，或用 ⇧ 在編輯器中開啟它們。";
"HTML Logs" = "HTML 日誌";
"Save your terminal logs in HTML format for enhanced readability and sharing capabilities." = "以 HTML 格式儲存終端機日誌，增強可讀性和分享能力。";
"ASCIICast Logs" = "ASCIICast 日誌";
"Create and play back terminal recordings with ASCIICast logs, compatible with asciinema." = "用 ASCIICast 日誌建立和回放終端機錄製，相容於 asciinema。";
"Timestamped Logs" = "帶時間戳的日誌";
"Include timestamps in your logs for better tracking and event correlation." = "在日誌中包含時間戳，便於追蹤和事件關聯。";
"LastPass & 1Password" = "LastPass 和 1Password";
"Utilize LastPass or 1Password with the password manager by configuring it in the menu next to the search field." = "透過搜尋框旁的選單設定，可在密碼管理器中使用 LastPass 或 1Password。";
"Password Manager Access" = "密碼管理器存取";
"Access your password manager without authentication by adjusting the settings via the menu next to its search field." = "透過搜尋框旁的選單調整設定，無需認證即可存取密碼管理器。";
"Password Generation" = "密碼產生";
"Generate strong, secure passwords using the password manager’s new password generation feature." = "使用密碼管理器的新密碼產生功能產生強健、安全的密碼。";
"it2tip Utility" = "it2tip 工具";
"Access tips of the day with the it2tip utility, a command line app. Enable it by installing shell integration and utilities." = "用 it2tip 工具（一個命令列應用程式）存取每日提示。透過安裝 Shell 整合和工具來啟用它。";
"Auto Shell Integration" = "自動 Shell 整合";
"Experience automatic shell integration when creating a login shell, removing the need for explicit setup on your Mac." = "建立登入 shell 時體驗自動 Shell 整合，無需在 Mac 上手動設定。";
"Command Prompt Info" = "指令提示資訊";
"Get detailed information about commands by ⌘-clicking on the command prompt." = "按住 ⌘ 點擊指令提示符可取得指令的詳細資訊。";
"tmux Integration" = "tmux 整合";
"Use tmux integration for automatic key bindings that emulate tmux’s shortcuts, configurable via the Leader settings." = "使用 tmux 整合可獲得模擬 tmux 快速鍵的自動按鍵綁定，可透過前導鍵設定配置。";
"tmux Clipboard Mirroring" = "tmux 剪貼簿鏡像";
"Sync your tmux paste buffer with the local clipboard for seamless integration (requires tmux 3.4)." = "將 tmux 貼上緩衝區與本地剪貼簿同步以實現無縫整合（需要 tmux 3.4）。";
"Multi-Cursor in Composer" = "編輯器中的多游標";
"Enhance your editing in the Composer with multiple cursors, created using ^⇧-up/down or ⌥-drag." = "在編輯器中用多游標增強編輯，透過 ^⇧-上/下或 ⌥-拖動建立。";
"Advanced Paste from Composer" = "從編輯器進階貼上";
"Move content from the Composer to the Advanced Paste window with ⌥⌘V for additional editing options." = "用 ⌥⌘V 將內容從編輯器移到進階貼上視窗，以獲得更多編輯選項。";
"Composer Search" = "編輯器搜尋";
"Search within the Composer using ⌘F to quickly find specific text." = "在編輯器中用 ⌘F 快速尋找特定文字。";
"Resize Composer" = "調整編輯器大小";
"Adjust the Composer’s height to suit your needs by dragging its bottom edge." = "拖動編輯器底邊可調整其高度以適應您的需求。";
"Explain Command" = "解釋指令";
"Learn more about your commands by ⌘-clicking in the Composer to open them in explainshell.com." = "在編輯器中按住 ⌘ 點擊指令可在 explainshell.com 中開啟，瞭解更多資訊。";
"Quick Command Send" = "快速傳送指令";
"Quickly send and remove commands in the Composer using ⌥⇧-enter." = "在編輯器中用 ⌥⇧-enter 快速傳送並移除指令。";
"Queue Commands" = "排隊指令";
"Queue up a command in the Composer to be sent after the current command finishes with ⌥-Enter." = "在編輯器中用 ⌥-Enter 將指令排隊，在目前指令完成後傳送。";
"Draggable Tip Window" = "可拖動的提示視窗";
"Reposition the Tip of the Day window conveniently on your screen, as it is now draggable." = "現在可以拖動每日提示視窗，方便地在螢幕上重新定位。";
"AI Chat" = "AI 對話";
"iTerm2 now has an AI Chat feature! Use “Window > AI Chats” or “Edit > Explain Output with AI”. The assistant can interact with your terminal (with your permission) and explain command output, adding annotations right in the terminal." = "iTerm2 現在有 AI 對話功能！用「視窗 > AI 對話」或「編輯 > 用 AI 解釋輸出」。助手可以（經您許可）與終端機互動並解釋指令輸出，直接在終端機中新增註解。";
"Web Browser Profiles" = "瀏覽器設定檔";
"You can configure a profile to be a web browser! In “Settings > Profiles > General”, set “Profile Type” to “Web Browser”. Key bindings, smart selection, and the password manager all work in browser sessions." = "您可以將設定檔設定為瀏覽器！在「設定 > 設定檔 > 一般」中，將「設定檔類型」設為「瀏覽器」。按鍵綁定、智慧選取和密碼管理器都能在瀏覽器工作階段中使用。";
"Adjacent Timestamps" = "相鄰時間戳";
"Timestamps can now be shown next to terminal content instead of overlapping. Configure it in “Settings > Profiles > Session > Timestamps”. Right-click on any line and select “Set Baseline for Relative Timestamps” to see time elapsed between lines." = "時間戳現在可以顯示在終端機內容旁邊而不是重疊。在「設定 > 設定檔 > 工作階段 > 時間戳」中設定。右鍵點擊任意行並選擇「為相對時間戳設定基準」可查看行之間的時間差。";
"Pretty-Print JSON" = "格式化 JSON";
"Select a block of JSON text and choose “Edit > Replace Selection > Replace with Pretty-Printed JSON” to make it readable. Perfect for debugging API responses and log files." = "選取一塊 JSON 文字並選擇「編輯 > 替換選取範圍 > 替換為格式化的 JSON」使其可讀。非常適合除錯 API 回應和日誌檔案。";
"Command Palette" = "指令面板";
"Open Quickly (⇧⌘O) is now a command palette! Just type the name of a menu item to activate it." = "快速開啟（⇧⌘O）現在是一個指令面板！只需輸入選單項目名稱即可啟用它。";
"Click Paths in Shell Prompts" = "點擊 shell 提示符中的路徑";
"Enable “Settings > Profiles > Terminal > Click on a path in a shell prompt to open Navigator” to navigate your filesystem by clicking on paths in your prompt. Requires Shell Integration." = "啟用「設定 > 設定檔 > 終端機 > 點擊 shell 提示符中的路徑以開啟導航器」，即可透過點擊提示符中的路徑來導覽檔案系統。需要 Shell 整合。";
"SSH File Browser" = "SSH 檔案瀏覽器";
"When connected via SSH Integration, use “Shell > ssh > Download Files” to browse and download files from the remote host without opening a new connection. Files on SSH hosts also appear in file open/save dialogs!" = "透過 SSH 整合連線時，用「Shell > ssh > 下載檔案」可瀏覽和下載遠端主機上的檔案，無需開啟新連線。SSH 主機上的檔案也會出現在檔案開啟/儲存對話框中！";
